  <para style="h">Daniyeli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu c’uwavugishwa n’Imana Daniyeli</para>
  <para style="toc2">Daniyeli</para>
  <para style="toc3">Dan</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu c’uwavugishwa n’Imana</para>
  <para style="mt1">Daniyeli</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DAN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Daniyeli ajanwa i Babiloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 1:1" />Mu mwaka ugira gatatu umwami Yehoyakimu w’i Buyuda ari ku ngoma, ni ho Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni yaja gutera i Yerusalemu arahugariza. <verse eid="DAN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 1:2" />Umwami Imana amuha kunesha Yehoyakimu umwami w’i Buyuda kandi yemera ko na bimwe mu bikoresho vyejejwe vyo mu Ngoro y’Imana abinyaga. Nebukadineza abitwara i Babiloni abishira mu nzu y’imana yiwe.<verse eid="DAN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 1:3" />Hanyuma umwami ategeka Ashipenazi, umukuru w’abakozi bo ku kirimba iwe, kumuzanira bamwe bo mu Bisirayeli bakomoka mu miryango y’abami n’iy’abubahwa, <verse eid="DAN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 1:4" />abasore b’amagara meza, b’akaranga, bashoboye kwiga ningoga, bafise impano y’ubwenge no gutahura kandi bashoboye gukora ku kirimba i bwami. Yategerezwa kubigisha ururimi n’ivyanditswe vy’i Babiloni. <verse eid="DAN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 1:5" />Umwami ategeka ko babagaburira ku vyo asanzwe afungura, bakanywa no ku muvinyu asanzwe anywa. Bategerezwa kumara imyaka itatu bigishwa, hanyuma bagaca batangura gukora i bwami.<verse eid="DAN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 1:6" />Mu basore bahisemwo, harimwo Daniyeli, Hananiya, Mishayeli na Azariya, bose bava i Buyuda. <verse eid="DAN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 1:7" />Umukuru w’abakozi b’i bwami abaha ayandi mazina: Daniyeli amwita Beluteshaza, Hananiya amwita Shadarake, Mishayeli amwita Meshake, Azariya na we amwita Abedinego.<verse eid="DAN 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 1:8" />Maze Daniyeli agira imigabo yo kutihumanisha ivyokurya n’umuvinyu vy’umwami, aca asaba umukuru w’abakozi b’i bwami ngo amwemerere kutavyihumanisha. <verse eid="DAN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 1:9" />Imana iha Daniyeli gutona no gukundwa n’uwo mukuru w’abakozi b’i bwami. <verse eid="DAN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 1:10" />Ariko abwira Daniyeli ati: “Umwami databuja ni we yategetse ivyo murya n’ivyo munywa. Niyabaraba agasanga muronze ntimusa n’abandi basore mungana, ndatinya ko azonca umutwe.”<verse eid="DAN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 1:11" />Nuko Daniyeli aca avugana n’uwari abajejwe, uwo umukuru w’abakozi b’i bwami yari yahaye igikorwa co gukurikirana Daniyeli, Hananiya, Mishayeli na Azariya, amubwira ati: <verse eid="DAN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 1:12" />“Turagusavye utugerageze imisi cumi, utureke turye imboga, tunywe n’amazi. <verse eid="DAN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 1:13" />Inyuma y’iyo misi uzorabe ingene tuzoba dusa utugereranije n’abandi basore barya ivyokurya vy’umwami. Hanyuma uzotugenze uko uzoba ubona bikwiye ukurikije ivyo uzoba wabonye.” <verse eid="DAN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 1:14" />Uwo yari abajejwe aravyemera, aca afata imisi icumi yo kubageza.<verse eid="DAN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 1:15" />Iyo misi icumi iheze, Daniyeli na bagenziwe baboneka bavyibushe, bafise amagara meza kandi basa neza kurusha ba basore bandi barya ivyokurya vy’umwami. <verse eid="DAN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 1:16" />Kuva ico gihe, umwe abajejwe aca abemerera kwama barya imboga, ntiyongera kubahatira ku vyokurya n’umuvinyu bari bategekanirijwe.<verse eid="DAN 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 1:17" />Imana iha abo basore bane kumenya no gutahura inyandiko z’uburyo bwinshi kandi zitandukanye no kugira ubwenge. Daniyeli we yarashobora gutahura no gusobanura ivyahishuwe mw’iyerekwa n’indoto z’uburyo bwose.<verse eid="DAN 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 1:18" />Igihe co kwiga cashinzwe n’umwami kirangiye, wa mukuru w’abakozi b’i bwami ajana ba basore imbere ya Nebukadineza. <verse eid="DAN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 1:19" />Umwami avugana na bo bose, ariko nta n’umwe yabonetse anganya ubwenge na Daniyeli, na Hananiya, na Mishayeli na Azariya. Nuko baca bakora ku kirimba i bwami. <verse eid="DAN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 1:20" />Igihe cose umwami ababajije ikintu ico ari co cose cerekeye ubwenge no gutahura, yama asanga barusha abanyamareba n’abapfumu bose bo mu bwami bwiwe incuro icumi.<verse eid="DAN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 1:21" />Nuko Daniyeli aguma akorera ku kirimba i bwami kugeza mu mwaka wa mbere w’ingoma y’umwami Kuro.<verse eid="DAN 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DAN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Indoto za Nebukadineza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 2:1" />Mu mwaka ugira kabiri ari ku ngoma, Nebukadineza yagize indoto zikomeye zituma vyanka ko asubira gusinzira. <verse eid="DAN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 2:2" />Aca atumako abanyamareba, abapfumu, abarozi n’abaragurisha kuraba inyenyeri, kugira ngo bamubwire ivyo yarose. Bashitse imbere yiwe, <verse eid="DAN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 2:3" />arababwira ati: “Narose indoto kandi yambujije amahoro. Ngomba kumenya ico isobanura.”<verse eid="DAN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 2:4" />Abaragurisha kuraba inyenyeri baramwishura bati: “Mwami nyaguhoraho, tubwire iyo ndoto twebwe abasavyi bawe, natwe turaheza tukubwire insobanuro yayo.”<verse eid="DAN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 2:5" />Umwami yishura abaragurisha kuraba inyenyeri ati: “Ng’iyi ingingo nafashe: nimutambwira indoto narose n’insobanuro yayo, muratemagurwa kandi n’inzu zanyu ndazihindura imisaka. <verse eid="DAN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 2:6" />Ariko nimwambwira iyo ndoto n’ingene isobanurwa, ndabaha ingabire nyinshi n’icubahiro cinshi. Nimumbwire rero indoto narose n’ico isigura!”<verse eid="DAN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 2:7" />Na bongera kwishura umwami bati: “Nyeningoma, ehe tubwire twebwe abasavyi bawe ivyo warose, hanyuma tukumenyeshe ingene bisobanurwa.”<verse eid="DAN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 2:8" />Umwami arabishura ati: “Ndabona ko muriko muragerageza kuraba ko umwanya woba urahera, kuko mubona ko namaze gufata ingingo. <verse eid="DAN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 2:9" />Ariko nimutambwira ivyo narose, mwese murindiriwe n’igihano kimwe. Mwamaze kuja inama mbi yo kumbesha, mwibaza ko mpava mpindura ingingo nafashe. Ubu rero mimumbwire indoto narose, hanyuma nca menya ko mushobora no kumbwira uko isobanurwa.”<verse eid="DAN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 2:10" />Abo baragurisha kuraba inyenyeri baramwishura bati: “Nta muntu n’umwe kw’isi ashobora gukora ivyo umwami adutegetse! Kandi nta mwami, uko yoba ahambaye kwose akaba n’agakomeye, yosaba ikintu nk’ico umunyamareba, umupfumu n’uwuragurisha kuraba inyenyeri n’umwe! <verse eid="DAN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 2:11" />Ivyo umwami asavye ntibishoboka. Nta muntu n’umwe yoshobora kukubwira ivyo warose atari imana, kandi izo na zo ntizibana n’abantu.”<verse eid="DAN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 2:12" />Umwami aca arashavura cane, mbere aca ategeka ko ba kamenyi bose b’i Babiloni bicwa. <verse eid="DAN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 2:13" />Icagezwe c’umwami kimaze gutangazwa ko ba kamenyi bose bicwa, baca barungika abantu kurondera Daniyeli na bagenziwe ngo na bo bicwe.<verse eid="DAN 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 2:14" />Igihe Ariyoki, umukuru w’abacungera umutekano w’umwami yari agiye kwica ba kamenyi, Daniyeli amenya ingene amuvugisha mu bwenge n’ubwitonzi. <verse eid="DAN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 2:15" />Abaza Ariyoki umukuru w’abacungera umutekano w’umwami ati: “Mbega ni kuki umwami yatanze itegeko riteye ubwoba nk’iryo?” Ariyoki aca amusigurira ivyabaye vyose. <verse eid="DAN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 2:16" />Ako kanya Daniyeli aca aja kuraba umwami kugira ngo amusabe umwanya wo kwitegura, hanyuma aze amusobanurire iyo ndoto.<verse eid="DAN 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 2:17" />Daniyeli arataha, abwira bagenziwe Hananiya, Mishayeli na Azariya ivyabaye. <verse eid="DAN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 2:18" />Arabahimiriza ngo basenge cane basabe Imana nyene ijuru ibagirire ubuntu ibamenyeshe iryo banga, kugira ngo ntibicanwe n’abandi ba kamenyi b’i Babiloni. <verse eid="DAN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 2:19" />Iryo joro nyene, Daniyeli ahishurirwa iryo banga mu buryo bw’inzozi. Daniyeli aca ahimbaza Imana yo mw’ijuru, <verse eid="DAN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 2:20" />avuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:20">“Izina ry’Imana rishirwe hejuru ibihe vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 2:20">ubwenge n’ubushobozi ni ivyayo.<verse eid="DAN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 2:21" />Ni yo igera ingene ibihe bikuranwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 2:21">ikuraho abami, ikimika abandi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:21">Iha ubwenge abanyabwenge</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 2:21">n’ugutahura abakurondera.<verse eid="DAN 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 2:22" />Ni yo ihishura ibihishijwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 2:22">ikamenya ibiri mu mwijima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 2:22">kandi umuco ubana na yo.<verse eid="DAN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 2:23" />Ndagutazira kandi ndaguhimbaza, Mana ya ba sogokuruza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 2:23">kuko wampaye ubwenge n’ubushobozi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:23">ukampa kumenya ivyo twakubajije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 2:23">ukatumenyesha indoto y’umwami.”<verse eid="DAN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daniyeli asobanura ya ndoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 2:24" />Maze Daniyeli aca aja kuraba Ariyoki, uwo umwami yari yatumye kwica ba kamenyi b’i Babiloni. Aramubwira ati: “Ntiwice ba kamenyi b’i Babiloni, njana iyo umwami ari ndamumenyeshe ico indoto yiwe isigura.”<verse eid="DAN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 2:25" />Ariyoki aca ajana Daniyeli iyo umwami ari yihuta, abwira umwami ati: “Naronse umwe mu banyagano b’Abayuda ashobora kukumenyesha ico indoto warose isigura.”<verse eid="DAN 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 2:26" />Umwami abaza Daniyeli, uwo bise Beluteshaza, ati: “Ni ivy’ukuri ko ushobora kumbwira indoto narose n’ingene isobanurwa?”<verse eid="DAN 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 2:27" />Daniyeli yishura umwami ati: “Nta muntu n’umwe yaba kamenyi, umupfumu, umunyamareba canke uwuragura yoshobora kukumenyesha iryo banga; <verse eid="DAN 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 2:28" />ariko hariho Imana iba mw’ijuru ishobora guhishura amabanga. Ni yo yahishuriye umwami Nebukadineza ibizoba muri kazoza. Indoto yawe hamwe n’ivyo weretswe vyaciye mu mutwe wawe igihe wari uryamye ku buriri bwawe ni izi:<verse eid="DAN 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 2:29" />Nyeningoma, igihe wari usinziriye, warose ivyerekeye ibihe bizoza kandi iyihishura amabanga yakweretse ibizoba mu gihe kiri imbere. <verse eid="DAN 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 2:30" />Ku binyerekeye, iryo banga sinarihishuriwe kubera ndusha abandi ubwenge, ariko ni kubera Imana igomba ko wewe Nyeningoma umenya ico indoto warose isigura kandi utahure ivyiyumviro vyatumye uhagarika umutima.<verse eid="DAN 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 2:31" />Nyeningoma, mu ndoto yawe wabonye igishushanyo kinini gisa n’umuntu gikayangana kandi giteye ubwoba gihagaze imbere yawe. <verse eid="DAN 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 2:32" />Umutwe w’ico gishusho wari ugizwe n’inzahabu nziza, amaboko n’igikiriza vyari bigizwe n’ifeza, inda n’urukenyerero vyari bigizwe n’umwakaka, <verse eid="DAN 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 2:33" />amaguru yaco yari agizwe n’ivyuma, ibirenge vyaco na vyo bikaba vyari bigizwe n’icuma kivanze n’ibumba. <verse eid="DAN 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 2:34" />Uriko uraraba, wabonye ibuye ridatewe n’umuntu n’umwe rivudutse ku musozi, riraza rikubita ibirenge vya ca gishusho bigizwe n’icuma kivanze n’ibumba, rirabijanjagura. <verse eid="DAN 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 2:35" />Nuko ca cuma na rya bumba, wa mwakaka, ya feza na ya nzahabu vyose bihinduka umukungugu, umuyaga uraza urabitumura, aho vyahora ntihasigara n’akamenyetso kavyo. Ariko iryo buye ryamenaguye ico gishusho rica rirakura, rivamwo umusozi munini wuzura isi yose.<verse eid="DAN 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 2:36" />Iyo ni yo ndoto yawe, ubu na ho ngira ndakubwire uko isobanurwa. <verse eid="DAN 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 2:37" />Nyeningoma, wewe uri umwami ahambaye cane mu bandi bami bose. Imana yo mw’ijuru yaguhaye ububasha bwinshi, ubushobozi, inkomezi n’icubahiro. <verse eid="DAN 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 2:38" />Yaguhaye gutegeka ahantu hose haba abantu, mbere n’ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba n’inyoni ibishira musi y’ubutware bwawe. Ni wewe rero uri uwo mutwe w’inzahabu w’ico gishusho.<verse eid="DAN 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 2:39" />Inyuma y’ubwami bwawe, hazoza ubundi bwami butazoba buhambaye nk’ubwawe, hanyuma haze n’ubwa gatatu bugereranywa n’umwakaka kandi na bwo butegeke isi yose. <verse eid="DAN 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 2:40" />Hanyuma hazoza ubwami bugira kane, buzoba bukomeye nk’icuma, buzomenagura busanzaze ubwami bwose bwabwitangiye imbere, kurya ivyuma bimenagura bigasanzaza ikintu cose. <verse eid="DAN 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 2:41" />Ibirenge n’amano wabonye, vyari bigizwe n’icuma kivanze n’ibumba, vyerekana ko ubwo bwami buzoba butagira ubumwe; ariko buzoba burimwo ubushobozi nk’ubw’icuma, nk’uko wabonye icuma cari kivanze n’ibumba. <verse eid="DAN 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 2:42" />Ariko nk’uko mu mano igice kimwe cari kigizwe n’icuma ikindi kigizwe n’ibumba, ubwo bwami hamwe buzoba bufise inkomezi, ahandi buzoba bufise intege nke. <verse eid="DAN 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 2:43" />Kandi nk’uko wabonye icuma cari kivanze n’ibumba, ni ko abantu b’ubwo bwami bazogerageza kugiriranira amasezerano yo kwifatanya. Ariko kurya icuma bidashobora gufatana neza n’ibumba, ni ko bitazokunda ko bwifatanya.<verse eid="DAN 2:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 2:44" />Ku ngoma z’abo bami, Imana yo mw’ijuru izokwihagurukiriza ubwami butazokwigera burangira canke ngo bukurweho n’ubundi. Buzorandura ubwo bwami bwose buburangize, ariko bwo buzokwamaho ibihe bidashira. <verse eid="DAN 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 2:45" />Insobanuro y’ivyo ni ibuye wabonye riva ku musozi kandi ridatewe n’ukuboko kw’umuntu n’umwe, rikikubita kuri ca gishusho, rikamenagura icuma, umwakaka, ibumba, ifeza n’inzahabu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 2:45">Imana ihambaye yeretse umwami ibizoba mu gihe kiri imbere. Iyo ndoto ni iy’ukuri kandi insobanuro yayo ni iyo kwizerwa.”<verse eid="DAN 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="DAN 2:46" />Umwami Nebukadineza aca yikubita hasi yubamye imbere ya Daniyeli, amuha icubahiro cinshi, atanga itegeko ngo bamubagire ibimazi bongere bamuturirire ibimota neza. <verse eid="DAN 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DAN 2:47" />Umwami abwira Daniyeli ati: “Ni ukuri, Imana yawe ni yo Mana iri hejuru y’ivyitwa imana vyose, iganza abami bose igahishura ibihishijwe, kuko washoboye guhishura iryo banga.”<verse eid="DAN 2:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DAN 2:48" />Hanyuma umwami aca aha Daniyeli ikibanza c’icubahiro, amuha n’ubundi bushimwe bwinshi, amuha kuganza abahanuzi b’umwami bose bo mu ntara ya Babiloni. <verse eid="DAN 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DAN 2:49" />Vyongeye, abisabwe na Daniyeli, umwami aha Shadarake, Meshake na Abedinego gutegeka intara yose ya Babiloni. Daniyeli we aguma ku kirimba i bwami.<verse eid="DAN 2:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DAN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Abanse gusenga igishusho c’inzahabu batererwa mu muriro uhinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 3:1" />Umwami Nebukadineza yacurishije igishusho mu nzahabu gifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itandatu z’uburebure n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitandatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 27 z’uburebure n’imetero 2,7 z’ubwaguke.</char></note> z’ubwaguke, hanyuma ategeka ko bagishinga mu kiyaya c’i Dura, mu ntara ya Babiloni. <verse eid="DAN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 3:2" />Aca ahamagaza abaganwa biwe, abatware, abacamanza, abanyabigega n’abandi batware bose bo mu ntara, ngo baze ku musi mukuru wo gushikiriza abantu ico gishusho yashinze. <verse eid="DAN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 3:3" />Nuko abaganwa biwe, abatware, abacamanza, abanyabigega n’abandi batware bose bo mu ntara baraza, bahagarara imbere y’ico gishusho.<verse eid="DAN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 3:4" />Hanyuma, uwujejwe ivyo birori aca arasemerera cane n’ijwi rirengera avuga ati: “Yemwe bantu bo mu mahanga yose, indimi zose, n’amoko yose, ng’ibi ivyo mutegerezwa gukora: <verse eid="DAN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 3:5" />Mucumva inzamba, imyironge, ikembe, inanga, imiduri n’ibindi bikoresho vyose bicurarangwa, bisamiranye, muce mwikubita hasi mwubamye, kugira ngo musenge ico gishusho c’inzahabu umwami Nebukadineza yashinze. <verse eid="DAN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 3:6" />Umuntu wese ataja kwikubita hasi ngo asenge ico gishusho, aca afatwa atererwe mw’itanure ry’umuriro uhinda.”<verse eid="DAN 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 3:7" />Maze, abo mu mahanga yose n’indimi zose n’amoko yose bumvise amajwi y’ivyo bicurarangisho, baca bikubita hasi imbere y’ico gishusho baragisenga, ico umwami Nebukadineza yari yahagaritse.<verse eid="DAN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 3:8" />Ivyo biheze, bamwe mu baragurisha kuraba inyenyeri baca baja kuraba umwami ngo bamubwire ivyerekeye Abayuda banse kwikubita imbere y’ico gishusho. <verse eid="DAN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 3:9" />Babwira umwami bati: “Umwami aragahora ku ngoma ibihe vyose! <verse eid="DAN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 3:10" />Nyeningoma, wari watanze itegeko ribwira abantu bose ko bacumva amajwi y’inzamba, imyironge, imiduri, amakembe n’ibindi bicurarangisho baca bapfukamira igishusho washinze bakagisenga. <verse eid="DAN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 3:11" />Kandi itegeko ryawe rivuga ko uwutumvira iryo tegeko aca atabwa mw’itanure ry’umuriro uhinda. <verse eid="DAN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 3:12" />Ariko rero, Nyeningoma, hariho Abayuda bamwe, ari bo Shadarake, Meshake na Abedinego, abo wahaye gutwara intara y’i Babiloni, batakwubaha na gatoya. Banse gusaba imana zawe kandi ntibemera gusenga igishusho cawe c’inzahabu wahagaritse.”<verse eid="DAN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 3:13" />Maze umwami Nebukadineza ararakara cane, ategeka ko bazana ningoga Shadarake, Meshake, na Abedinego. Baca barabazana. <verse eid="DAN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 3:14" />Arababaza ati: “Ni ivy’ukuri ga Shadarake, Meshake, na Abedinego ko mwanse gukorera imana zanje no gusenga igishusho c’inzahabu nahagaritse? <verse eid="DAN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 3:15" />Ubu rero, mukimara kwumva amajwi y’inzamba, imyironge, amakembe, inanga, n’imiduri n’ibindi bicurarangisho vyose, muce mupfukama musenge ico gishusho. Mutabikoze, muca mutererwa mw’itanure ry’umuriro uhinda. Mbega ni iyihe mana yoshobora kubakura mu kuboko kwanje?”<verse eid="DAN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 3:16" />Shadarake, Meshake, na Abedinego baramwishura bati: “Nyeningoma Nebukadineza, ntibikenewe ko twisigura kuri ivyo. <verse eid="DAN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 3:17" />Nimba duterewe mw’itanure ry’umuriro uhinda, Imana dukorera irashobora kuturokora muri iryo tanure ry’umuriro uhinda, kandi iraturokora idukure mu bubasha bwawe, Nyeningoma. <verse eid="DAN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 3:18" />Ariko n’aho itobikora, twagomba tukumenyeshe neza, Nyeningoma ko tudashobora gukorera imana zawe kandi ko tudashobora gusenga igishusho c’inzahabu washinze.”<verse eid="DAN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 3:19" />Nebukadineza arakarira cane Shadarake, Meshake, na Abedinego, mu maso hiwe harahinduka, aca ategeka ko bacanira itanure incuro indwi kurusha uko ryahora <verse eid="DAN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 3:20" />hanyuma aca ategeka abasoda biwe bakomeye gufata Shadarake, Meshake, na Abedinego, kubaboha no kubaterera muri iryo tanure ry’umuriro uhinda. <verse eid="DAN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 3:21" />Nuko barabafata babaterera muri iryo tanure ry’umuriro bambaye amakanzu, amapantaro, imyitwikiro n’ibindi vyo gushaza. <verse eid="DAN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 3:22" />Kandi kubera yuko umwami mu burake bwiwe yategetse ko itanure baricanira incuro indwi kurenza uko ryahora, imbeya z’umuriro w’iryo tanure ziturira abasoda bagiye guterera Shadarake, Meshake, na Abedinego muri ryo. <verse eid="DAN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 3:23" />Abo bagabo batatu, uko nyene baboshwe, bagwa muri iryo tanure ry’umuriro uhinda.<verse eid="DAN 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 3:24" />Mu nyuma, umwami Nebukadineza aca ava hasi atangaye cane, abaza abahanuzi biwe ati: “Mbega harya abantu twaboshe tugaterera mw’itanure si batatu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 3:24">Baramwishura bati: “Egome, ni uko Nyeningoma.”<verse eid="DAN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 3:25" />Aca avuga ati: “Raba! Jewe mbonayo abantu bane bagendagenda mu muriro, bataboshe kandi ata na kimwe babaye, kandi uwugira kane asa n’umwana w’imana!”<verse eid="DAN 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 3:26" />Nebukadineza aca aragenda yegera ku muryango w’iryo tanure hanyuma arasemerera cane ati: “Shadarake, Meshake, na Abedinego, basavyi b’Imana Musumbavyose, nimusohoke! Nimuze hano!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 3:26">Shadarake, Meshake, na Abedinego baca barasohoka bava muri iryo tanure. <verse eid="DAN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 3:27" />Abaganwa biwe, abajejwe urugo rwiwe, abatware n’abahanuzi biwe bose baraza barabashengerera. Baravye basanga umuriro ntiwigeze ubaturira na gatoya, ndetse n’umushatsi wabo nta co wigeze uba, impuzu zabo ntizahiye kandi babimotereje basanga nta n’umwotsi banuka.<verse eid="DAN 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 3:28" />Maze Nebukadineza aca avuga ati: “Imana ya Shadarake, Meshake, na Abedinego, iragahezagirwa kuko yarungitse umumarayika wayo gukiza aba basavyi bayo bayizigiye! Banse, kwumvira amategeko yanje, bemera gutanga imibiri yabo ngo iturirwe aho gukorera no gusenga iyindi mana itari Imana yabo. <verse eid="DAN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 3:29" />Kuva ubu rero, ntanze iri tegeko ko umuntu wo mw’ihanga iryo ari ryo ryose canke w’ururimi urwo ari rwo rwose, azogira ijambo ribi avuga ku Mana ya Shadarake, Meshake, na Abedinego, azohimbagurwamwo ibihimba, kandi inzu yiwe ihinduke umusaka, kuko nta yindi mana ishobora gukiza nk’uku!”<verse eid="DAN 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 3:30" />Hanyuma umwami aha icubahiro gikomeye mu kazi kabo Shadarake, Meshake, na Abedinego, mu ntara ya Babiloni.<verse eid="DAN 3:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DAN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Nebukadineza arota igiti kinini</para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 4:1" />Umwami Nebukadineza arungika ubu butumwa ati:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="DAN 4:1">Ku mahanga yose n’abantu bavuga ururimi rwose, baba kw’isi yose:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="DAN 4:1">“Amahoro n’iterambere bibe muri mwebwe!”<verse eid="DAN 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 4:2" />Binteye umunezero kubamenyesha ivyerekeye ibitangaza n’ibimenyetso, n’utwumiza Imana Musumbavyose yankoreye.<verse eid="DAN 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="qm1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 4:3" />Mbega ukuntu ibimenyetso vyayo bikomeye;</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 4:3">n’ubushobozi buri mu bitangaza vyayo!</para>
  <para style="qm1" vid="DAN 4:3">Ubwami bwayo ni ubw’ibihe bidashira;</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 4:3">kandi inganji yayo yamaho uko urunganwe rukurikirana n’urundi.<verse eid="DAN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 4:4" />Jewe, Nebukadineza, nari ku kirimba iwanje, nguwe neza kandi nteye imbere. <verse eid="DAN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 4:5" />Hanyuma ijoro rimwe ndarota kandi iyo ndoto yanteye ubwoba bwinshi. Nari ndyamye ku buriri bwanje; hanyuma nerekwa ibintu vyandanduye umutima. <verse eid="DAN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 4:6" />Maze, nca ntanga itegeko ryo guhamagaza abanyabwenge bose b’i Babiloni ngo baze bambwire ico iyo ndoto ivuga. <verse eid="DAN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 4:7" />Igihe abanyamareba, abapfumu, abaragurisha kuraba inyenyeri, abahamagara imizimu baza, nta n’umwe yashoboye kumbwira ico isobanura. <verse eid="DAN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 4:8" />Mu nyuma, ni ho Daniyeli ari we Beluteshaza yaza, ansobanurira ivy’iyo ndoto. Iryo zina yarihawe kubera ryegeranye n’izina ry’imana yanje, ariko impwemu y’imana zitagira agasembwa iba muri we.<verse eid="DAN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 4:9" />Ndamubwira nti: “Beluteshaza, mukuru w’abapfumu bose, ndazi neza ko impwemu y’imana zitagira agasembwa iri muri wewe kandi ko ata binyegejwe wewe udashobora kumenya. Iyi ni yo ndoto yanje, mbwira rero uko isobanurwa. <verse eid="DAN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 4:10" />Igihe nari ndyamye ku buriri bwanje, nabonye igiti kinini cane kiri hagati kw’isi. <verse eid="DAN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 4:11" />Ico giti kirakura kiba kinini kandi kiba kirekire, gikora ku bicu ku buryo umuntu wese aho ari kw’isi hose yashobora kukibona. <verse eid="DAN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 4:12" />Cari gifise amababi meza n’ivyamwa vyinshi ku buryo abantu bose bashobora kubiryako. Ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba vyaraza bikibera mu gitutu caco, inyoni na zo zikarika mu mashami yaco. Icaremwe cose cashobora kurya ivyamye kuri co.<verse eid="DAN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 4:13" />Mu vyo neretswe, nkiryamye kuri ubwo buriri, mbona imbere yanje hari intumwa yejejwe imanutse iva mw’ijuru. <verse eid="DAN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 4:14" />Ica ivuga n’ijwi rirenga iti: ‘Icira ico giti, mugikureko n’amashami yaco, mugikunkumure kandi ivyamwa vyaco mubisanzaze, hanyuma mwirukane ibikoko biri mu gitutu caco hamwe n’inyoni ziri mu mashami yaco. <verse eid="DAN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 4:15" />Igishitsi caco n’imizi mubireke, ariko mubiboheshe iminyororo y’ivyuma n’iy’imiringa, ivyatsi bitotahaye bikirenge hejuru.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="DAN 4:15">Mukireke gitondweko n’urume ruva kw’ijuru, kibane n’ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba. <verse eid="DAN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 4:16" />Kandi mu gihe kingana n’imyaka indwi, ntikize congere kugira ivyiyumviro nk’ivy’abantu, ariko kigire ivyiyumviro nk’ivy’ibikoko.<verse eid="DAN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 4:17" />Iyo ngingo yatangajwe n’intumwa, ku rubanza ruciwe n’uwejejwe, kugira ngo umuntu wese ahumeka amenye ko Imana Musumbavyose, iri hejuru y’ingoma zose zo kw’isi kandi yimika uwo ishatse, ikamushira hejuru yazo, naho yoba ari uwo musi y’abandi bose.’<verse eid="DAN 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 4:18" />Iyo ni yo ndoto, Jewe umwami Nebukadineza nagize. Ubu rero, wewe Beluteshaza, mbwira uko isobanurwa, kuko nta n’umwe wo mu banyabwenge bose bo mu bwami bwanje, ashobora kuyinsobanurira. Ariko, nzi neza ko wewe ushobora gutahura ico ivuga, kuko impwemu y’imana zitagira agasembwa iri muri wewe.”<verse eid="DAN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daniyeli asobanura iyo ndoto</para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 4:19" />Maze Daniyeli ari we bise Beluteshaza aca amara umwanya mu gacerere arengewe n’ivyiyumviro. Ariko, umwami aramubwira ati: “Ntuterwe ubwoba n’iyo ndoto canke ukwo isobanurwa.”</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="DAN 4:19">Na we aca ambwira ati: “Nyeningoma, ese icompa ivyo iyo ndoto ivuga bikaba ku bansi n’insiguro yayo ikaba ku bakugwanya!” <verse eid="DAN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 4:20" />Ico giti wabonye cakuze cane kandi kigakomera, kikaba kirekire ku buryo gikora kw’ijuru kigashobora kubonwa n’abari kw’isi yose, <verse eid="DAN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 4:21" />amababi yaco yari meza cane kandi kigatanga ivyamwa bikwiye ku vyaremwe vyose, ibikoko bikibera mu gitutu caco kandi n’inyoni zikarika mu mashami yaco. <verse eid="DAN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 4:22" />Nyeningoma, ico giti ni wewe. Wabaye uwuhambaye n’uwukomeye, icubahiro cawe gishika kw’ijuru kandi ubwami bwawe bwuzuye isi yose.<verse eid="DAN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 4:23" />Nyeningoma wabonye uwutagira agasembwa amanuka avuye mw’ijuru azanye ubutumwa, avuga ati: “Ico giti nimucicire mugihonye! Ariko igishitsi caco n’imizi mubirekere mw’ivu, biboheshejwe iminyororo y’ivyuma n’iy’imiringa. Mukirekere mu vyatsi bitotahaye, kimare imyaka indwi gitondwako n’urume.”<verse eid="DAN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 4:24" />Nyeningoma, iyi ni yo nsobanuro, Imana Musumbavyose yatanze itegeko kuri wewe mwami Nyeningoma: <verse eid="DAN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 4:25" />uzokurwa mu bantu uje kubana n’ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba; uzorisha ivyatsi nk’inka, utondweko n’urume rwo kw’ijuru. Ibihe indwi bizokuranwa kuri wewe, kugeza aho uzotahurira ko Iyisumbavyose ari yo iganza ubwami bwose bwo mw’isi, ikabuha uwo ishatse wese. <verse eid="DAN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 4:26" />Itegeka ko igishitsi n’imizi babireka. Ivyo bisobanurwa ko uzosubira ku ngoma yawe, umaze gutahura ko Imana yo mw’ijuru ari yo iganza vyose. <verse eid="DAN 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 4:27" />Nuko, Nyeningoma, ndagusavye wakire impanuro ndaguhaye: “Uve mu vyaha vyawe utangure kubaho mu bugororotsi; ugirire imbabazi abahahazwa. Ni ho ivyawe bizogenda neza, ugatera imbere ikindi gihe kirekire.”<verse eid="DAN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ingene iyo ndoto yashitse</para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 4:28" />Ivyavuzwe ku mwami Nebukadineza vyaramushitseko vyose. <verse eid="DAN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 4:29" />Inyuma y’amezi icumi n’abiri, yariko agendagenda hejuru ku kirimba i Babiloni, <verse eid="DAN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 4:30" />maze aravuga ati: “Mbega aha si i Babiloni, igisagara gihambaye ahari ikirimba niyubakiye n’ubushobozi bwanje ngo kimpeshe icubahiro?”<verse eid="DAN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 4:31" />Ayo majambo akiva mu kanwa kiwe, haza ijwi rivuye mw’ijuru rimubwira riti: “Mwami Nebukadineza, iyi ni yo ngingo yafashwe kuri wewe, ububasha buva ku ngoma urabwatswe. <verse eid="DAN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 4:32" />Uzokurwa mu bantu hanyuma uje kubana n’ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba; aho uzorisha ivyatsi nk’inka. Uzomara imyaka indwi ibihe bigukuranwako, kugeza igihe uzotahurira ko Imana Musumbavyose ari yo iganza ingoma zose zo kw’isi kandi ko ingoma yose iyiha uwo ishatse.”<verse eid="DAN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 4:33" />Ubwo nyene, ivyari vyavuzwe kuri Nebukadineza vyaciye bishika. Yaciye akurwa mu bantu, hanyuma arisha ubwatsi nk’inka. Umubiri wiwe utondwako n’urume rwo kw’ijuru kugeza aho umushatsi wiwe wakuze ukamera kurya kw’amoya y’inkona n’inzara ziwe zirakura zimera nk’iz’inyoni.<verse eid="DAN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 4:34" />Iyo myaka indwi iheze, jewe Nebukadineza, narangamije mw’ijuru, ubwenge buragaruka. Maze nca ntangura gutazira no gushima Iyisumbavyose no guha icubahiro Ibaho ibihe bitazoshira.</para>
  <para style="qm1" vid="DAN 4:34">Inganji yayo ntizorangira,</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 4:34">kandi ingoma yayo izohoraho uko urunganwe ruzogenda rusubirira urundi.<verse eid="DAN 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="qm1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 4:35" />Abantu bose bo kw’isi,</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 4:35">baboneka bameze nk’ubusa.</para>
  <para style="qm1" vid="DAN 4:35">Ikora ivyo ishatse,</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 4:35">n’ubushobozi bwo mw’ijuru</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 4:35">hagati mu bantu bo kw’isi.</para>
  <para style="qm1" vid="DAN 4:35">Nta muntu n’umwe ashobora gufata ukuboko kwayo,</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 4:35">canke ngo ayibaze ati: “Mbega aho wakoze iki?”<verse eid="DAN 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 4:36" />Uwo mwanya nyene nasubijwe ubwenge, nsubizwa n’ubwiza n’icubahiro vyanje, kugira ngo ingoma yanje igire ubwiza. Abahanuzi n’abandi banyacubahiro banje baca barandondera hanyuma nsubizwa ku ngoma yanje, mbere nca mba uwuhambaye kurusha uko nari imbere y’aho. <verse eid="DAN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 4:37" />Ubu rero, jewe Nebukadineza, ndahimbaza kandi ngaha icubahiro nongera nshima Umwami wo mw’ijuru. Kuko ibikorwa vyiwe ni ivy’ukuri kandi biragororotse, ashobora no gucisha bugufi abibone bose.<verse eid="DAN 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DAN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Igikonjo candika ku ruhome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 5:1" />Hashize imyaka myinshi, umwami Belushaza agirira umusi mukuru abantu igihumbi bo mu baganwa n’abatware biwe, basangira umuvinyu. <verse eid="DAN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 5:2" />Igihe Belushaza yariko aranywa uwo muvinyu, aca atanga itegeko ngo bazane ibikombe bikozwe mu nzahabu no mw’ifeza, ivyo se Nebukadineza yari yaranyaze mu rusengero i Yerusalemu, kugira ngo we, abaganwa n’abatware biwe, hamwe n’abagore n’incoreke ziwe babinyweshe. <verse eid="DAN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 5:3" />Nuko, bazana ivyo bikombe bikozwe mu nzahabu no mw’ifeza vyanyazwe mu rusengero rw’Imana i Yerusalemu, umwami, abaganwa n’abatware biwe, abagore biwe n’incoreke barabinywesha. <verse eid="DAN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 5:4" />Bariko baranywa, bahimbaza ibigirwamana vyabo bikozwe mu nzahabu, mw’ifeza, mu mwakaka, mu vyuma, mu biti no mu mabuye.<verse eid="DAN 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 5:5" />Ubwo nyene, umwami aja abona igikonjo kiriko kirandika ibintu ku gihome cera kiri impande y’igiterekwako amatara. <verse eid="DAN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 5:6" />Akibonye, afatwa n’ubwoba bwinshi, mu maso harahinduka. Amavi yiwe arakomangana kubera kudegezwa, kandi amaguru yiwe acika intege.<verse eid="DAN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 5:7" />Umwami aca arasemerera ngo bamuzanire abapfumu, abaragurisha kuraba inyenyeri n’abahamagara imizimu. Maze aca abwira abo banyabwenge b’i Babiloni ati: “Umuntu wese ansomera birya vyandiko akambwira n’ico bisigura, azoca yambikwa impuzu y’inyambarabami, yambikwe n’umugufu w’inzahabu mw’izosi. Azoca ahabwa ikibanza ca gatatu mu banyacubahiro bo hejuru muri ubu bwami.”<verse eid="DAN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 5:8" />Abanyabwenge bose baraza, ariko nta n’umwe muri bo yashoboye gusoma iyo nyandiko canke kuvuga ico isobanura. <verse eid="DAN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 5:9" />Umwami akomeza kumererwa nabi, mbere no mu maso hiwe akomeza kwiraburanirwa, kandi abanyacubahiro biwe babura ico bari bukore.<verse eid="DAN 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 5:10" />Nyina w’umwami, yumvise ijwi ry’umwami n’amajwi y’abanyacubahiro biwe, aca yihutira kuja mu cumba c’amazimano. Maze abwira umwami ati: “Umwami arakaramba! Ntugire ubwoba ngo ucike intege, kandi ntiwiraburanirwe. <verse eid="DAN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 5:11" />Mu bwami bwawe, hariho umuntu afise impwemu y’imana zitagira agasembwa. Ku ngoma y’umwami, so, uwo mugabo yarerekanye ko afise ubumenyi n’ubwenge busa n’ubw’imana. Ni co catumye umwami so amuha kugaba abanyamareba, abapfumu, n’abaragurisha kuraba inyenyeri, n’abahamagara imizimu. <verse eid="DAN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 5:12" />Uwo mugabo Daniyeli, uwo umwami yataziriye Beluteshaza, vyarabonetse ko afise ubushobozi budasanzwe, kandi yuzuye ukumenya no gutahura, kandi agashobora no gusobanura indoto, kumenya ibihishijwe no gutora inyishu z’ibibazo bigoye. Tumako Daniyeli, arakubwira ico iyo nyandiko ivuga.”<verse eid="DAN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 5:13" />Nuko Daniyeli ashikanwa imbere y’umwami. Umwami aramubaza ati: “Ni wewe Daniyeli, umwe wo mu nyagano data yazanye akuye i Buyuda? <verse eid="DAN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 5:14" />Bambwiye ko impwemu z’imana ziba muri wewe kandi ko ufise kumenya, gutahura hamwe n’ubwenge. <verse eid="DAN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 5:15" />Abanyabwenge n’abaraguzi babazanye baragerageza kunsomera amajambo yanditswe ku gihome ariko ntibabishoboye. <verse eid="DAN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 5:16" />Numvise rero ko wewe woshobora kunsobanurira iyo nyandiko kandi ko ushobora no gutora inyishu y’ibibazo bigoye. Hamwe woshobora kunsomera iyo nyandiko no kumbwira ico isobanura, uzokwambikwa impuzu y’icubahiro y’i bwami, wambikwe n’umugufu w’inzahabu mw’izosi, uhabwe ikibanza ca gatatu mu banyacubahiro bo hejuru muri ubu bwami.”<verse eid="DAN 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 5:17" />Daniyeli yishura umwami ati: “Ndagusomera iyo nyandiko, ndakubwire n’uko isobanurwa. Ariko ingabire zawe zigumirize canke uzihe uwundi.”<verse eid="DAN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 5:18" />Nyeningoma, Iyisumbavyose yahaye so Nebukadineza ubushobozi, icubahiro, no kuba uwuhambaye, <verse eid="DAN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 5:19" />Icubahiro yamuhaye catumye abantu bo mu moko yose, n’amahanga yose, n’indimi zose bajugumira imbere yiwe. Yarica abo ashatse kwica, agakiza abo agomba gukiza, kandi agaha icubahiro abo ashatse kugiha, agacisha bugufi uwo ashatse gucisha bugufi. <verse eid="DAN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 5:20" />Ariko, igihe agiriye ubwibone mu mutima wiwe no mu vyiyumviro vyiwe, yacishijwe bugufi, yakwa ingoma yiwe n’ubwiza bw’icubahiro ciwe. <verse eid="DAN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 5:21" />Yakuwe mu bantu, ahabwa ivyiyumviro vy’igikoko, abana n’indogoba zo mw’ishamba kandi arisha ubwatsi nk’inka; umubiri wiwe utondwako n’urume, kugeza umusi yatahuriye ko Iyisumbavyose ari yo itegeka ubwami bwose bwo kw’isi kandi ko ari yo ishira ku ngoma uwo ishatse.<verse eid="DAN 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 5:22" />“Kandi nawe Belushaza umuhungu wiwe, naho wari uzi ivyo vyose, ntiwicishije bugufi. <verse eid="DAN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 5:23" />Ahubwo wishize hejuru imbere y’Imana yo mw’ijuru. Wategetse ko bazana ibikombe vyo mu Ngoro yiwe, kugira ngo wewe n’abanyacubahiro bawe, abagore bawe n’incoreke zawe, babinyweshe umuvinyu. Uhimbaza ibigirwamana bikozwe mu nzahabu, mw’ifeza, mu mwakaka, mu vyuma, mu biti no mu mabuye, bidashobora kubona, kwumva canke gutahura. Ariko ntiwahaye icubahiro Imana kandi ari yo ifise ubugingo bwawe mu kiganza cayo, ikanamenya kazoza kawe. <verse eid="DAN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 5:24" />Ni co gituma Imana yatumye ico gikonjo kwandika ayo majambo.<verse eid="DAN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 5:25" />Ibi ni vyo vyari vyanditswe:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="DAN 5:25">
    <char style="sc">mene, mene, tekeli, parisini</char><verse eid="DAN 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 5:26" />Uku ni ko ayo majambo asobanurwa:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 5:26">
    <char style="tl">Mene</char> risobanurwa ngo ‘Imana yaharuye imyaka umaze ku ngoma, iyishizeko iherezo.’<verse eid="DAN 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 5:27" />
    <char style="tl">Tekeli</char> risobanurwa ngo ‘wapimwe ku munzane, basanga nta bilo bikwiye ufise.’<verse eid="DAN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 5:28" />
    <char style="tl">Parisini</char> risobanurwa ngo ‘ubwami bwawe buragabuwe, buhawe Abamedi n’Abaperesi.’ ”<verse eid="DAN 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 5:29" />Ubwo nyene Belushaza aca atanga itegeko, ko bambika Daniyeli impuzu y’icubahiro y’i bwami, yambikwe n’umugufu w’inzahabu mw’izosi, kandi ko ahabwa ikibanza ca gatatu mu banyacubahiro bo hejuru muri ubwo bwami.<verse eid="DAN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 5:30" />Iryo joro nyene, Belushaza umwami w’i Babiloni aricwa, <verse eid="DAN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 5:31" />hanyuma Dariyusi Umumedi aca atwara ubwo bwami. Yari afise imyaka mirongo itandatu n’ibiri.<verse eid="DAN 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DAN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Daniyeli atererwa mu rwobo rurimwo intare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 6:1" />Umwami Dariyusi, atoranya abatware ijana na mirongo ibiri, umwe wese amuha intara atwara, <verse eid="DAN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 6:2" />abo na bo abaha abakuru batatu bo kubarongora, umwe muri abo batatu akaba yari Daniyeli. Abo batware bategerezwa kwereka abo bakuru batatu ingene bakoze akazi kabo, kugira ngo barabe ntihagire ikintu na kimwe umwami ahomba. <verse eid="DAN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 6:3" />Daniyeli akora ibikorwa vyiwe neza kurusha abandi bakuru, n’abatware bose, bituma umwami agira imigabo yo kumwegurira gutwara ubwami bwose. <verse eid="DAN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 6:4" />Kubera ivyo, abakuru hamwe n’abatware b’intara bagerageza kurondera ikosa bokwagiriza Daniyeli bakuye mu bikorwa akora, ariko bararibura, kuko yari umwizigirwa, akirinda ingurire no kwanjanjwa ku bikorwa. <verse eid="DAN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 6:5" />Ni ho abo bagabo bavuga bati: “Nta kirego na kimwe tuzoronka co kwagiriza Daniyeli, kiretse tukirondeye mu bijanye n’ivyagezwe vy’Imana yiwe.”<verse eid="DAN 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 6:6" />Abo bakuru hamwe n’abatware, baragenda, babwira umwami bati: “Nyaguhoraho, mwami Dariyusi! <verse eid="DAN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 6:7" />Twebwe twese abakuru, abatware, abahanuzi, n’abakuru b’intara bose, twahuje inama yo kugusaba ngo ushireho itegeko ribuza umuntu wese gusubira gusenga iyindi mana n’imwe canke uwundi muntu n’umwe atari wewe, kumara imisi mirongo itatu. Uwuzobikora wese, azoce atererwa mu rwobo rurimwo intare. <verse eid="DAN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 6:8" />None rero Nyeningoma, bategure iryo tegeko, hanyuma urishireko umukono kugira ngo ntirize rihinduke, kurya nyene amategeko y’Abamedi n’Abaperesi adahinduka.” <verse eid="DAN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 6:9" />Nuko umwami Dariyusi yemeza iryo tegeko yongera arishirako umukono wiwe.<verse eid="DAN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 6:10" />Ariko, Daniyeli yumvise ko iryo tegeko ryashinzwe, aca aja i muhira iwe, yurira mu cumba ciwe co hejuru, yugurura amadirisha atumbereye i Yerusalemu. Arapfukama arasenga, gatatu ku musi nk’uko yamenyereye, ashimira Imana yiwe. <verse eid="DAN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 6:11" />Maze ba batware bagenda ari umugwi baja kwa Daniyeli, basanga ariko arasenga asaba Imana ngo imutabare. <verse eid="DAN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 6:12" />Baca bagenda ubwo nyene ku kirimba kuraba umwami, bamwibutsa itegeko yashinze, bati: “Nyeningoma, burya ntiwashinze itegeko rivuga ko mu misi mirongo itatu ata muntu yemerewe gusenga iyindi mana canke uwundi muntu, atari wewe, kandi ko uwuzorirenga azoca atererwa mu rwobo rurimwo intare?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 6:12">Umwami arabishura ati: “Egome, ni ko biri, kandi ni itegeko ry’Abamedi n’Abaperesi ridashobora guhinduka.”<verse eid="DAN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 6:13" />Baca babwira umwami bati: “Daniyeli, umwe mu baje ari inyagano bavuye i Buyuda, ntakwubaha kandi ntiyubahiriza n’iryo tegeko ryawe. Akomeza gusenga Imana yiwe gatatu ku musi.” <verse eid="DAN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 6:14" />Umwami amaze kwumva ivyo, aca arababara cane, aca agira ishaka ryo gutabara Daniyeli, agerageza uko ashobora kwose kuraba ingene yomukiza kugeza izuba rirenze.<verse eid="DAN 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 6:15" />Ku mugoroba, ba bagabo bagenda ari umugwi baja kuraba umwami, baramubwira bati: “Nyeningoma, ibuka ko nk’uko amategeko y’Abamedi n’Abaperesi ameze, ata tegeko umwami yashizeko umukono wiwe rishobora guhindurwa.”<verse eid="DAN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 6:16" />Amaherezo umwami avuga ko bazana Daniyeli bakamuta mu rwobo rw’intare. Umwami aramubwira ati: “Ese, Imana yawe ukorera mu bwizigirwa yokurokora.”<verse eid="DAN 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 6:17" />Hanyuma, bazana ikibuye kinini co kwugaza umuryango w’urwo rwobo, umwami arushirako ikidodo ciwe n’ic’abanyacubahiro biwe, kugira ngo yemeze ko ata muntu n’umwe yemerewe guhindura ingingo yafashwe ku vya Daniyeli. <verse eid="DAN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 6:18" />Kuva ubwo, umwami aca aja ku kirimba iwe, akesha ijoro ryose adafunguye kandi ata kintu na kimwe co kumunezereza yemeye ko bamuzanira, kandi biranka ko asinzira.<verse eid="DAN 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 6:19" />Hakiri mu mutwenzi, butaraca neza, umwami arazinduka yihutira kuja kuri rwa rwobo rw’intare. <verse eid="DAN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 6:20" />Ashitse hafi y’urwo rwobo, ahamagara Daniyeli n’ijwi ririmwo umubabaro ati: “Daniyeli, musavyi w’Imana nzima, mbega Imana ukorera mu bwizigirwa, yoba yashoboye kukuzigama intare ntizigire ico zikugira?”<verse eid="DAN 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 6:21" />Daniyeli aramwishura ati: “Nyeningoma mwami, urakaramba! <verse eid="DAN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 6:22" />Imana yanje yarungitse umumarayika wayo, yugara iminwa y’intare. Nta kintu zangize kuko nabonetse ko ata kibi nakoze imbere yayo, kandi ata n’ico nakoze imbere yawe, Nyeningoma.”<verse eid="DAN 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 6:23" />Umwami aca aranezerwa cane, atanga itegeko ngo bamukure muri urwo rwobo rw’intare. Kandi bamaze gukura Daniyeli muri ico kinogo, nta n’agakwabu kari ku mubiri wiwe, kuko yizigiye Imana yiwe.<verse eid="DAN 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 6:24" />Hanyuma, umwami aca atanga itegeko ko bafata ba bagabo bagira uwo mugambi wo gutega umutego Daniyeli; barabazana babaterera muri rwa rwobo rw’intare bari kumwe n’abagore babo n’abana babo. Intare zibasamira mu kirere, zibatabagura bataranashika hasi muri rwo, zivunagura amagufa yabo.<verse eid="DAN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 6:25" />Ivyo biheze, umwami Dariyusi aca arungikira ubutumwa abantu bo mu moko yose n’ihanga ryose n’imvugo yose, baba kw’isi yose ati:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="DAN 6:25">“Amahoro no kuroranirwa bibane namwe mwese!”<verse eid="DAN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 6:26" />“Ntanze itegeko ko mu bwami bwanje iyo buva bukagera abantu bose batinya kandi bagaha icubahiro Imana ya Daniyeli.</para>
  <para style="qm1" vid="DAN 6:26">Kuko ni Imana nzima</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 6:26">kandi ibaho ibihe bidashira.</para>
  <para style="qm1" vid="DAN 6:26">Ingoma yayo ntizokwigera ikurwaho,</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 6:26">kandi inganji yayo ntizokwigera irangira.<verse eid="DAN 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="qm1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 6:27" />Iratabara, igakiza abantu bayo;</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 6:27">ikora ibimenyetso n’utwumiza</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 6:27">mw’ijuru no mw’isi.</para>
  <para style="qm1" vid="DAN 6:27">Yakijije Daniyeli</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="DAN 6:27">ubushobozi bw’intare.”<verse eid="DAN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 6:28" />Hanyuma Daniyeli akomeza gutera imbere igihe cose Dariyusi yamaze ku ngoma no ku ngoma ya Kuro umuperesi.<verse eid="DAN 6:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DAN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Daniyeli arota ibikoko bine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 7:1" />Mu mwaka wa mbere umwami Belushaza ari ku ngoma i Babiloni, Daniyeli yararose, kandi mu vyiyumviro vyiwe hacamwo ibintu vyinshi biza mu buryo bwo kwerekwa, aryamye ku buriri. Ivyo yarose yaravyanditse.<verse eid="DAN 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 7:2" />Daniyeli avuga ati: “Mu vyo neretswe mw’ijoro, nabonye imiyaga ivuye ku mpande zine z’isi yisuka mu kiyaga kinini. <verse eid="DAN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 7:3" />Hanyuma, mbona ibikoko bininibinini bine bisokoroka biva mu kiyaga. Nta gikoko na kimwe casa n’ikindi.<verse eid="DAN 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 7:4" />Igikoko ca mbere casa n’intare, kandi cari gifise amababa y’inkona. Nkomeje kuraba, mbona amababa yaco aravunaguwe hanyuma gica gihagarara cemye kurya kw’umuntu kandi gihabwa kugira kamere k’umuntu.<verse eid="DAN 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 7:5" />Hanyuma nca mbona igikoko ca kabiri gisa n’idubu. Cari kiryamiye uruhande rumwe kandi gifise amagufa atatu y’imbavu mu kanwa, hagati y’amenyo. Numva ijwi rikibwira riti: ‘Vyuka, urye inyama nyinshi!’<verse eid="DAN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 7:6" />Inyuma y’ivyo, nca mbona ikindi gikoko, casa n’ingwe. Ku mugongo cari gifise amababa ane nk’ay’inyoni, kikagira n’imitwe ine. Ico gikoko gihabwa ububasha bwo gutegeka.<verse eid="DAN 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 7:7" />Muri iryo joro, nkiriko nderekwa, mbona igikoko kigira kane: cari giteye ubwoba cane, kandi gikomeye rwose. Amenyo yaco yari manini kandi akozwe mu vyuma; carajanjagura ivyo cishe kikabirya, ibisigaye kikabisiribanga n’amaguru yaco. Cari gitandukanye cane n’ibindi bikoko kandi cari gifise amahembe cumi.<verse eid="DAN 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 7:8" />Nkiriko ndiyumvira ivyerekeye ayo mahembe yaco, nca mbona akandi gahembe gatoya gasokorotse hagati mu yandi mahembe kandi amahembe atatu aca akurwaho kugira ngo karonke ikibanza. Ako gahembe gatoya kari gafise amaso nk’ay’umuntu n’umunwa, kakavugana ubwibone.<verse eid="DAN 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 7:9" />Ndiko ndaraba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:9">mbona intebe z’inganji zishirwa mu bibanza vyazo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 7:9">hanyuma mbona uwusa n’Umukurambere, araje aricara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:9">Impuzu ziwe, zarera derere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 7:9">umushatsi wiwe ugasa n’ubwoya bw’intama bwera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:9">Intebe yiwe yari igizwe n’imbeya z’umuriro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 7:9">iteretswe ku mapine yaka urubeya.<verse eid="DAN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 7:10" />Kandi uruzi rw’umuriro rwatemba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 7:10">ruva imbere yiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:10">Abantu ibihumbi n’ibihumbi bari ngaho bamukorera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 7:10">kandi ibihumbi cumi incuro ibihumbi cumi bari bahagaze ngaho bamushengereye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:10">Urubanza ruratangura;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 7:10">hanyuma ibitabu birazingururwa.<verse eid="DAN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 7:11" />Nkomeza kwitegereza, numva ka gahembe kariko kavuga amajambo y’ubwibone. Nshishikara kuraba kugeza aho ca gikoko ca kane cicwa, umuvyimba waco utererwa mw’itanure ry’umuriro uragitongora. <verse eid="DAN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 7:12" />Vya bikoko bindi bitatu, ubutware bwavyo birabwakwa, ariko vyemererwa kuba birabayeho ikindi gihe.<verse eid="DAN 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 7:13" />Muri uko kwerekwa mw’ijoro, nkomeza kuraba ivyo ndiko nderekwa, ngize gutya mbona uwusa n’Umwana w’Umuntu aje azananye n’ibicu vyo kw’ijuru. Yegera wa mukurambere, ashikanwa imbere yiwe. <verse eid="DAN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 7:14" />Aca ahabwa ububasha, ubwiza n’ubushobozi bwo kuganza; amahanga yose yo kw’isi, n’abavuga indimi zitandukanye baramutazira. Ukuganza kwiwe kuzohoraho ibihe bidashira kandi ingoma yiwe ntizokwigera ikurwaho.<verse eid="DAN 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Insiguro y’iyo ndoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 7:15" />Jewe Daniyeli, nca mpagarika umutima, kandi ivyo neretswe bituma mbura amahoro. <verse eid="DAN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 7:16" />Nca negera umwe mu bari ngaho hafi y’iyo ntebe y’inganji ndamubaza ico ivyo bisigura.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 7:16">Nuko aca abinsobanurira gutya: <verse eid="DAN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 7:17" />Birya bikoko binini cane bine, bisigura ubwami bune buzohaguruka bugatwara isi. <verse eid="DAN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 7:18" />Ariko, kw’iherezo, abantu b’Imana Musumbavyose, ni bo bazohabwa ubwami, kandi bazoganza ibihe n’ibihe.<verse eid="DAN 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 7:19" />Hanyuma nca nipfuza kumenya ivyerekeye igikoko ca kane, kuko cari gitandukanye rwose n’ibindi kandi giteye ubwoba cane kubera ayo menyo yaco y’ivyuma hamwe n’inzara z’imwakaka. Ico gikoko ivyo cishe, caca kibijanjagura, kikarya ivyo cishe ibisigaye kikabisiribanga n’amaguru yaco. <verse eid="DAN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 7:20" />Kandi ndasubira ndondera kumenya ivyerekeye amahembe cumi ari ku mutwe waco n’ivyerekeye ka gahembe kandi gatoya kameze mu nyuma kandi kagatuma atatu aca akoroka. Ako gahembe wamenga kabaye agahambaye kuruta ayo yandi kandi kakaba gafise amaso nk’umuntu n’umunwa uvuga amajambo y’ubwibone. <verse eid="DAN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 7:21" />Nkiriko ndaraba, mbona ako gahembe kagwanya abera b’Imana kandi kakabanesha, <verse eid="DAN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 7:22" />kugeza igihe wa mukurambere yaza, aca acira urubanza rwiza abatoranijwe b’Imana Musumbavyose, kuko igihe c’uko bahabwa ubwami cari kigeze.<verse eid="DAN 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 7:23" />Maze, aca aransobanurira ati: Kirya gikoko ca kane, ni ubwami bwa kane buzohaguruka kuganza isi. Buzoba butandukanye n’ubundi bwami bwabwitangiye imbere kandi buzotabagura isi yose, buyisiribange kandi buyijanjagure. <verse eid="DAN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 7:24" />Amahembe yaco cumi, ni abami cumi bazotegeka ubwo bwami. Hanyuma uwundi mwami atandukanye n’abo cumi azokwima kandi azokuraho abami batatu. <verse eid="DAN 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 7:25" />Uwo mwami azovuga ibintu bibi ku Mana Musumbavyose, kandi azogirira nabi cane abera b’Imana, agerageze guhindura amabwirizwa y’Imana n’imisi mikuru yashinzwe. Abera b’Imana bazoshirwa mu maboko yiwe ikiringo kingana n’igihe, n’ibihe bibiri, hamwe n’igice c’igihe.<verse eid="DAN 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 7:26" />Ariko, mu nyuma ubucamanza buzomucira urubanza, n’ubushobozi bwose abwakwe, hanyuma arandurwe ibihe vyose. <verse eid="DAN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 7:27" />Ni ho ukuganza, ubushobozi, no gushirwa hejuru kwose kw’ubwami buri musi y’izuba buzohabwa abera b’Iyisumbavyose. Ubwami bwiwe buzokwamaho ibihe bidashira, kandi abatware bose bazomutazira bamwumvire.<verse eid="DAN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 7:28" />Aho ni ho ukwerekwa kwagarukiye. Jewe, Daniyeli, nagize ubwoba bwinshi kubera ivyiyumviro vyinshi bivuye ku vyo neretswe, mu maso hanje hariraburanirwa, ariko ndabigumiza mu mutima wanje.”<verse eid="DAN 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DAN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Daniyeli yerekwa impfizi y’intama n’impfizi y’impene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 8:1" />Mu mwaka ugira gatatu umwami Belushaza ari ku ngoma, jewe Daniyeli nongeye kwerekwa ibindi, bikurikira ivyo nari mperutse kubona. <verse eid="DAN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 8:2" />Muri ukwo kwerekwa, nabona ndi i Suza, igisagara gikomeye c’i Babiloni co mu ntara yitwa Elamu; muri ukwo kwerekwa mbona mpagaze impande y’Uruzi rwitwa Ulayi. <verse eid="DAN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 8:3" />Ngize gutya, mbona impfizi y’intama ifise amahembe abiri, ihagaze i ruhande y’urwo ruzi, kandi ayo mahembe yari maremare. Ihembe rimwe ryari rirerire gusumba irindi, ariko mu nyuma na ryo n’irindi naryo rirakura. <verse eid="DAN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 8:4" />Iyo mpfizi y’intama igenda iraseka itumbereye mu burengero, mu buraruko no mu bumanuko. Nta gikoko na kimwe cari gikomeye ku buryo coshoboye kuyihangara, kandi nta kintu na kimwe cashobora kunanira ubushobozi bwayo. Yakora uko ishaka, mbere igera aho iba agahambaye cane.<verse eid="DAN 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 8:5" />Nkiriko ndavyiyumvirako, ubwo nyene nca mbona impfizi y’impene ifise ihembe rimwe hagati y’amaso, ije ivuye mu burengero, mbona igendagenda kw’isi yose kandi ikanyaruka ku buryo wamenga amaguru ntiyakora no hasi. <verse eid="DAN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 8:6" />Igenda itumbereye ya mpfizi y’intama nari nabonye ihagaze i ruhande y’uruzi, yiruka iyitumbereye ifise uburake bwinshi. <verse eid="DAN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 8:7" />Mbona iyigwanya n’ishavu ryinshi, iseka iyo ntama ivuna ya mahembe yompi. Iyo mpfizi y’intama nta bushobozi yari igifise bwo kugwana n’iyo mpfizi y’impene, iyikubita hasi irayisiribanga. Nta muntu n’umwe yari gushobora gutabara iyo mpfizi y’intama ngo ayikure mu maboko y’iyo mpfizi y’impene. <verse eid="DAN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 8:8" />Iyo mpfizi y’impene ica iba agahambaye. Ariko igeze aho ikomera cane, rya hembe ryayo rirerire riravunika. Mu kibanza c’iryo hembe rirerire, hamera ayandi mahembe ane atumbereye impande zine z’isi.<verse eid="DAN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 8:9" />Maze, mu kibanza c’ihembe rimwe muri ayo, hamera ihembe ritoya ariko rica rirakomera rigira ububasha bwinshi butumbereye mu bumanuko, mu buseruko no mu gihugu ciza Isirayeli. <verse eid="DAN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 8:10" />Ako gahembe karakomera gashikira amajuru, kugeza aho kagwanya ingabo zo kw’ijuru, kandi zimwe muri zo kazikubita hasi, karazisiribanga. <verse eid="DAN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 8:11" />Mbere kagwanya umukuru w’ingabo zo mw’ijuru mu kubuza abantu kumuha ibimazi no mu gusambura urusengero rwiwe. <verse eid="DAN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 8:12" />Ingabo zo mw’ijuru zirabujijwe kuja kugwanya ubwo bugarariji. Maze, ikimazi gitangwa imisi yose nticaba kigitangwa, ukuri nakwo kurahonyangwa. Ako gahembe kagira intsinzi mu vyo kakora vyose.<verse eid="DAN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 8:13" />Hanyuma numva abera babiri bo mw’ijuru bavugana, umwe abaza mugenziwe ati: “Mbega ivyo vyerekanywe bizofata igihe kingana iki? Ivyerekanywe vyerekeye umugararizo utuma ikimazi cama gitangwa ku musi ku musi, gihagarikwa hamwe no guhumanya urusengero? Urusengero n’abantu b’Imana bizoba musi y’ububasha bw’ako gahembe kugeza ryari no gusiribangirwa musi y’ibirenge vyako?”<verse eid="DAN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 8:14" />Uwundi aramwishura ati: “Kugira ngo urusengero ruhumanurwe kandi rwongere gukora, hazoca amajoro n’ibitondo ibihumbi bibiri n’amajana atatu.”<verse eid="DAN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Insobanuro y’ivyo neretswe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 8:15" />Igihe nariko nderekwa ngerageza gutahura ivyo mbonye ivyo ari vyo, nabonye uwusa n’umuntu aje ahagaze imbere yanje. <verse eid="DAN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 8:16" />Kandi ngaho impande y’uruzi Ulayi, hava ijwi rimeze nk’iry’umuntu rivuga riti: “Gaburiyeli, bwira uwo mugabo insobanuro y’ivyo yeretswe.”<verse eid="DAN 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 8:17" />Maze Gaburiyeli yegereye aho nari mpagaze, ngira ubwoba bwinshi nca nikubita hasi nubamye. Aca arambwira ati: “Mwana w’umuntu, tahura ko ivyo weretswe vyerekeye igihe c’iherezo.”<verse eid="DAN 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 8:18" />Akiriko aravuga, nca ncika intege, ngwa hasi nubamye. Ariko Gaburiyeli ankorako, aramvyura arampagarika.<verse eid="DAN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 8:19" />Hanyuma aca ambwira ati: “Ngiye kukubwira ibizoba hanyuma mu gihe Imana izokwerekana uburake bwayo, kuko ivyo weretswe vyerekeye igihe cashinzwe c’iherezo. <verse eid="DAN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 8:20" />Amahembe abiri y’intama asobanura abami b’Abamedi n’Abaperesi. <verse eid="DAN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 8:21" />Impfizi y’impene na yo, isobanura ubwami bw’Abagiriki, ihembe rirerire ryayo riri hagati y’amaso risigura umwami wa mbere w’ubwo bwami bw’Abagiriki. <verse eid="DAN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 8:22" />Amahembe ane yasubiriye rimwe ryavunika, yerekana ko ubwo bwami bw’Abagiriki buzogabanganywa, havemwo ubwami bune, ariko ntibuzoba bukomeye nka bumwe bwa mbere.<verse eid="DAN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 8:23" />Ubwo bwami bugiye kurangira, igihe ibicumuro vyabwo bizoba vyuzuye, hari uwundi mwami azokwima, azoba ari inkozi y’ikibi kandi ari indyarya. <verse eid="DAN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 8:24" />Azokomera cane, ariko bitavuye ku bushobozi bwiwe. Azokwica ibintu vyinshi kandi ivyo agomba gukora vyose azobishikako. Azotikiza abarongozi bakomeye kandi yice abera b’Imana. <verse eid="DAN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 8:25" />Ibinyoma vyiwe bizotuma ashishikara kuja imbere, bitume yishira hejuru; kandi azokwica abantu benshi giturumbuka yongere agwanye Umwami w’abami, mu nyuma azovunagurwa, ariko bitavuye ku nkomezi z’umuntu.<verse eid="DAN 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 8:26" />Ivyo weretswe vyerekeye amajoro n’ibitondo ni ukuri. Ariko ubigire ibanga kuko bizoba haciye igihe kirekire.”<verse eid="DAN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 8:27" />Hanyuma, jewe Daniyeli nca numva ncitse intege. Ndakumbagara, mara imisi myinshi ngwaye. Maze mu nyuma ndavyuka, nkora ibikorwa nari njejwe gukorera umwami. Ariko nari mbabajwe cane n’ivyo neretswe kuko ntashobora kwumva neza ivyo ari vyo.<verse eid="DAN 8:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DAN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Isengesho rya Daniyeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 9:1" />Mu mwaka wa mbere umwami Dariyusi Umumedi mwene Ahasuwerusi, agiye ku ngoma, ngo abe umwami w’i Babiloni, <verse eid="DAN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 9:2" />muri uwo mwaka wa mbere w’ingoma yiwe nyene, jewe Daniyeli natahujwe n’ivyo nsomye mw’Ijambo ry’Uhoraho, nk’uko uwavugishwa n’Imana Yeremiya yabihishuriwe, rivuga ko Yerusalemu hazomara imyaka mirongo indwi ari umusaka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Umusaka. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ahantu hasambuwe canke hashaje, hatakiba abantu.</char></note> <verse eid="DAN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 9:3" />Nca mpindukirira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana, ntangura gutakamba ndayisenga nongera ndayinginga, nisonzesheje, nambaye amagunira kandi nisize iminyota.<verse eid="DAN 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 9:4" />Nsenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanje kandi ndatura nti:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="DAN 9:4">“Ewe Uhoraho, Mana nkuru kandi uhambaye, wama ushitsa kandi ukazigama amasezerano y’urukundo ukunda abagukunda bakitondera ivyagezwe vyawe; <verse eid="DAN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 9:5" />twaracumuye kandi twakoze ibibi. Twarakugararije ntitwubaha amabwirizwa n’amategeko yawe. <verse eid="DAN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 9:6" />Ntitwumviye abakozi bawe ari bo bavugishwa, bavuga mw’izina ryawe babwira abami bacu n’abaganwa bacu, ba sogokuruza hamwe n’abantu bose bo mu gihugu.<verse eid="DAN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 9:7" />Ewe Mana, wewe uragororotse, ariko uwu musi twuzuye ibimaramare. Ni ko biri ku Bayuda, ku baba i Yerusalemu no ku Bisirayeli bose, abari hafi n’abari kure, iyo bari mu bihugu vyose wabashwiragijemwo bitewe n’ukubura ubwizigirwa imbere yawe. <verse eid="DAN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 9:8" />Twebwe n’abami bacu, abaganwa na ba sogokuruza, twese twuzuye ibimaramare kuko twagucumuyeko. <verse eid="DAN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 9:9" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu, uri umunyakigongwe none tugirire imbabazi, naho twakugararije. <verse eid="DAN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 9:10" />Ntitwumviye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu, kuko tutakurikiye amabwirizwa yaduhaye biciye ku bakozi biwe ari bo bavugishwa. <verse eid="DAN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 9:11" />Abisirayeli bose bararenze ku vyagezwe vyawe, barahindukira, banka kukwumvira.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="DAN 9:11">Ni co gituma imivumo yose hamwe n’imanza zanditswe mu Vyagezwe vy’umusavyi wawe Mose, vyadusutsweko, kuko twagucumuyeko. <verse eid="DAN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 9:12" />Washikije ivyo wari waravuze ko uzodukorera twebwe n’abatware bacu mu kudushitsako icago kinini gutya. Kw’isi yose, nta na hamwe higeze haba ivyago nk’ivyabaye i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="DAN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 9:13" />Nk’uko vyanditswe mu Gitabu c’Ivyagezwe vya Mose, ibi vyago vyose vyadushitseko, ariko ntitwigeze turondera ukugirirwa neza n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu mu guhindukira no mu kuva mu vyaha vyacu tugashira umutima ku kuri kwayo. <verse eid="DAN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 9:14" />Wewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntiwatevye kutuzanako ibi vyago kuko wewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu ugororotse mu vyo ukora vyose; natwe tukaba twaranse kukwumvira.<verse eid="DAN 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 9:15" />Uhoraho Mana yacu, wewe wakuye abantu bawe muri Egiputa ukoresheje ukuboko kwawe kw’inkomezi, ukironkera izina ryama ryibukwa kugeza uyu musi, twaragucumuyeko, twakoze ibibi. <verse eid="DAN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 9:16" />Ewe Mana, mu gukomeza ibikorwa vyawe vy’ukugororoka, kura ishavu ryawe n’uburake bwawe kuri Yerusalemu, igisagara cawe, umusozi wawe watoranije. Ivyaha vyacu hamwe n’ibigabitanyo vya ba sogokuruza vyatumye Yerusalemu n’abantu bawe, bashinyagurirwa n’abahakikuje bose.<verse eid="DAN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 9:17" />Ewe Uhoraho Mana yacu, wumve ugusenga n’ukwinginga kw’umusavyi wawe. Ku bw’icubahiro cawe Mana, rabana imbabazi urusengero rwawe rwahindutse umusaka. <verse eid="DAN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 9:18" />Ewe Mana yacu, tega ugutwi unyumve. Utereze inyonga zawe witegereze ukuntu igisagara citirirwa izina ryawe casanganguwe. Ntitugutakambiye kubera tugororotse, ahubwo ni kubera imbabazi zawe ari nyinshi. <verse eid="DAN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 9:19" />Uhoraho utwumvirize! Uhoraho utubabarire. Ewe Uhoraho, niwumve wongere ukore! Ku bw’icubahiro cawe, ntutebe, ewe Mana, ku bw’abantu bawe n’igisagara cawe vyitirirwa izina ryawe.”<verse eid="DAN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amayinga mirongo indwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 9:20" />Nkiriko ndavuga nongera nsenga, natura ivyaha vyanje n’ivyaha vy’ubwoko bwanje bw’Abisirayeli, nsaba <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanje nsabira umusozi wayo wejejwe, <verse eid="DAN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 9:21" />nkiriko ndasenga, Gaburiyeli, umwe nari nabonye mw’iyerekwa rya mbere, aza aho ndi anyaruka, hari nk’igihe co gutanga ikimazi co ku mugoroba. <verse eid="DAN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 9:22" />Arambarira ati: “Daniyeli, nzanywe no kukwungura ubwenge no kugufasha gutahura.” <verse eid="DAN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 9:23" />Kuva ugitangura gusenga, hatanzwe itegeko ari na ryo rinzanye, kuko uri uw’igiciro mu nyonga z’Imana. Wumvirize neza kugira ngo ushobore gutahura ico ivyo weretswe bivuga.<verse eid="DAN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 9:24" />Igihe kingana n’amayinga mirongo indwi y’imyaka, ni co cashinzwe ku bw’abantu bawe n’igisagara catoranijwe kugira ngo barangize ubugarariji bwabo, n’ivyaha vyabo bihongerwe, haze ubugororotsi bw’Imana butazoshira, ivyavuzwe n’abavugishwa n’Imana hamwe n’ivyo beretswe bishike, hanyuma Ahera Cane h’urusengero hongere hahumanurwe.<verse eid="DAN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 9:25" />Ubu rero, umviriza kandi utahure: kuva igihe itegeko ryo gusubira kwubaka Yerusalemu rizosohokera, hazohera amayinga indwi y’imyaka agwije incuro indwi, hanyuma habe ayandi mayinga mirongo itandatu n’abiri y’imyaka, hanyuma haze umurongozi yasizwe amavuta. Igisagara ca Yerusalemu kizokwubakwa hamwe n’amabarabara yaho, mugabo bizokorwa mu bihe bigoye cane. <verse eid="DAN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 9:26" />“Inyuma y’ayo mayinga mirongo itandatu n’abiri, uwasizwe amavuta azokwicwa, mu buryo bw’akarenganyo. Inyuma y’aho, ingabo zo mu bwoko bw’umutware w’umunyamahanga azoza zizosangangura igisagara n’urusengero. Umuhero uzoza nk’umwuzure w’amazi, kandi kuva ico gihe intambara n’ivyago bizokomeza kugeza kw’iherezo ry’ibihe. <verse eid="DAN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 9:27" />Uwo mutware azoza, azogirana amasezerano n’abantu benshi mu kiringo c’imyaka indwi, ariko ico gihe kigeze hagati, azokuraho ivyo gutanga ibimazi n’amashikanwa. Kugira ngo ibikorwa vyiwe bibi vyuzure, azoshinga mu rusengero ikintu kizira, bitume urusengero ruhumana, bizoguma gutyo kugeza aho iherezo ryiwe rizoshikira nk’uko vyashinzwe.”<verse eid="DAN 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DAN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ibindi Daniyeli yeretswe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 10:1" />Mu mwaka ugira gatatu, umwami Kuro w’Ubuperesi ari ku ngoma, hariho ibindi Daniyeli (ari we bise Beluteshaza) yeretswe. Ubutumwa yaronse bwari ubw’ukuri kandi bwari bwerekeye ibihe vy’intambara ihambaye. Daniyeli yumviriza cane ivyo abwiwe hanyuma abitahuzwa n’ivyo yeretswe.<verse eid="DAN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 10:2" />Ico gihe, Jewe Daniyeli, namaze amayinga atatu yose ngandaye. <verse eid="DAN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 10:3" />Nta vyokurya vyiza canke inyama nafungura, nta n’umuvinyu nanywa kandi nta n’amavuta nisiga mu maso canke mu mutwe kugeza ayo mayinga atatu aheze.<verse eid="DAN 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 10:4" />Ku musi ugira mirongo ibiri na kane w’ukwezi kwa mbere, nari mpagaze ku nkombe y’uruzi runini Tigiri, <verse eid="DAN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 10:5" />nunamuye amaso, mbona umuntu yambaye impuzu zikayangana, afise mu rukenyerero umukanda w’inzahabu ziva muri Ufazi. <verse eid="DAN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 10:6" />Umubiri wiwe wasa n’akabuye k’igiciro kinini kitwa topazi, mu maso hiwe hakaravya nk’imiravyo, kandi amaso yiwe yamurika kurya kw’amatara, amaboko n’amaguru vyiwe, vyarakayangana kurya kw’umwakaka iyo wasenywe neza, kandi ijwi ryiwe ryasamirana nk’amajwi y’abantu isinzi.<verse eid="DAN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 10:7" />Jewe Daniyeli ni jewe jenyene nabonye ivy’iryo yerekwa, abagabo twari kumwe nta na kimwe babonye, ariko bagize ubwoba bwinshi baca bariruka kwinyegeza. <verse eid="DAN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 10:8" />Nasigaye ngaho jenyene, ndaba iryo yerekwa ry’igitangaza. Nta nkomezi na nkeya nari ngifise, mu maso hanje hariraburanirwa hasa n’ah’uwapfuye kandi ngira intege nke cane. <verse eid="DAN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 10:9" />Mu nyuma numvise wa muntu avuga, kandi numvise ugusamirana kw’ijwi ryiwe, nca ncika intege nikubita hasi nubamye.<verse eid="DAN 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 10:10" />Numva ukuboko kuje kunkorako kuramvyura, ndapfukama kandi nshira ibiganza hasi, ariko nari ngihinda agashitsi. <verse eid="DAN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 10:11" />Hanyuma wa muntu arambwira ati: “Daniyeli, wa muntu we w’igiciro kinini, umviriza neza ivyo ngomba kukubwira, kandi haguruka, kuko nagutumweko.” Amaze kumbwira ivyo, nca ndahaguruka mpinda agashitsi.<verse eid="DAN 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 10:12" />Maze aca arabandanya ati: “Daniyeli, ntutinye. Kuva umusi wa mbere watanguriyeko gusenga usaba gutahura kandi wicishije bugufi imbere y’Imana yawe, amajambo yawe yarumvikanye mw’ijuru, none nje nkuzaniye inyishu y’amasengesho yawe. <verse eid="DAN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 10:13" />Ariko impwemu itegeka ubwami bw’Ubuperesi yaranzibiye imisi mirongo ibiri n’umwe. Hanyuma Mikaheli, umwe mu bamarayika bakuru, aca araza kuntabara, kuko ni ho nari mbohewe n’umutware w’ubwami bw’Ubuperesi. <verse eid="DAN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 10:14" />None rero, nzanywe no kukumenyesha ibizoba ku bwoko bwawe muri kazoza, kuko iyerekwa wagize ryerekeye igihe kizoza.”<verse eid="DAN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 10:15" />Akiriko arambwira, nca nunamika amaso, biranka n’uko mvuga. <verse eid="DAN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 10:16" />Hanyuma umwe asa n’umuntu aca ankora ku minwa, nca nshobora guteranura akanwa no kuvuga. Nca mbwira umwe ahagaze imbere yanje nti: “Mwami wanje, erega nuzuye umubabaro kubera ivyo neretswe, kandi mfise intege nke cane. <verse eid="DAN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 10:17" />Mbega Mwami wanje, umusavyi wawe nkanje yoshobora kugira ico akubwiye? Inkomezi zamvuyemwo, ndetse no guhema birangora.”<verse eid="DAN 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 10:18" />Umwe asa n’umuntu arongera ankorako, nca numva inkomezi ziragarutse. <verse eid="DAN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 10:19" />Arambwira ati: “Nta co utinya, kuko uri uw’igiciro kinini ku Mana. Gira amahoro! Komera! Komera!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 10:19">Ariko arambwira ayo majambo, ubwo nyene nca numva ngize inguvu nca ndamubwira nti: “Mwami wanje, ndagusavye umbwire ndakwumva kuko wanyongeye inkomezi.”<verse eid="DAN 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 10:20" />Nuko aca ambwira ati: “Mbega urazi icatumye nza? Ubu ngira nsubire kugwana n’impwemu itegeka Ubuperesi, kandi maze kurengana, impwemu itegeka Ubugiriki izoca iza. <verse eid="DAN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 10:21" />Ariko ngira ndakubwire ivyanditswe mu Gitabu c’Ukuri. Muri urwo rugamba nta n’umwe antabara kiretse Mikaheli, umumarayika wanyu.”<verse eid="DAN 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DAN 11" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 11:1" />Kandi mu mwaka wa mbere Dariyusi Umumedi ari ku ngoma, nari kumwe na we ndamutera intege.<verse eid="DAN 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abami bo mu bumanuko n’abo mu buraruko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 11:2" />“Ubu rero ngomba ndakumenyeshe ukuri kwose: Hari abandi bami batatu b’Ubuperesi bazoza, hanyuma bakurikirwe n’uwa kane, uwo azoba atunze kubarusha bose. Azokoresha ubutunzi bwiwe kugira ngo ahere umuntu wese yomufasha kugwanya ubwami bw’Abagiriki. <verse eid="DAN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 11:3" />Maze hazoca haza umwami akomeye azoganzanya ububasha bwinshi, akore ico agomba cose. <verse eid="DAN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 11:4" />Ariko ashitse ku kunengesera kw’ugukomera kw’ubwami bwiwe, ubwo bwami buzosambuka bwigabanyemwo ubwami bune. Abami batamukomokako ni bo bazoganza ubwo bwami, ariko ntibazogira ububasha nk’ubwo yari afise. Kuko iyo ngoma izorandurwa igahabwa abandi.<verse eid="DAN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 11:5" />Umwami wo mu bumanuko azokomera, ariko umwe mu ngabo ziwe azomurusha inguvu, ace aganza ubundi bwami bwiwe mu bubasha bwinshi. <verse eid="DAN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 11:6" />Inyuma y’imyaka mikeya hazoba amasezerano hagati y’umwami wo mu bumanuko n’umwami wo mu buraruko. Umukobwa w’umwami wo mu bumanuko azorongorwa n’umwami wo mu buraruko kugira ngo bakomeze ayo masezerano. Ariko uwo mukobwa ntazozigama ububasha bwiwe, ndetse n’uwo mwami n’ububasha bwiwe ntibizorama. Azokwicanwa n’uwamuzanye, na se wiwe, hamwe n’uwuzoba amushigikiye.<verse eid="DAN 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 11:7" />Umwe mu ncuti z’uwo mukobwa azohaguruka asubire mu gishingo c’umwami. Azotegura ingabo, agende asange umwami wo mu buraruko mu bwihisho bwiwe amutsindeho. <verse eid="DAN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 11:8" />Asubiye muri Egiputa, azosubiranayo ibigirwamana vyabo hamwe n’ubutunzi bwinshi bw’inzahabu n’ifeza. Inyuma y’imyaka mikeya, azoreka umwami wo mu buraruko. <verse eid="DAN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 11:9" />Igihe kanaka giheze, umwami wo mu buraruko azotera ikirimba c’ubwami bwo mu bumanuko, ariko azoca asubira iwe vuba. <verse eid="DAN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 11:10" />Abahungu b’umwami wo mu buraruko, bazokwegeranya ingabo zikomeye zizosendanisha nk’umwuzure bagwane kugeza bashitse aho umwansi yihisha.<verse eid="DAN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 11:11" />Inyuma y’aho, umwami wo mu bumanuko azohagurukana ishavu ryinshi, yegeranye ingabo nyinshi aje kugwanya za ngabo nyinshi zegeranijwe n’umwami wo mu buraruko, azitsinde. <verse eid="DAN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 11:12" />Inyuma y’iyo ntsinzi azogira ubwibone bwinshi, yice ingabo nyinshi z’abansi biwe. Ariko intsinzi yiwe ntizorama. <verse eid="DAN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 11:13" />Inyuma y’imyaka mikeya, umwami wo mu buraruko azomanuka afise ingabo nyinshi kandi zifise ibigwanisho kurusha ubwa mbere.<verse eid="DAN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 11:14" />Ico gihe, hazoba abantu benshi bahagurukiye umwami wo mu bumanuko ngo bamurwanye, mbere n’abantu b’abagwanyi bo mu bwoko bwawe bazokwifatanya na bo kugira ngo bashitse ivyo iyerekwa ryavuze ariko ntibazobishobora. <verse eid="DAN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 11:15" />Mu nyuma umwami wo mu buraruko azoza yugarize igisagara kizitijwe inzitiro z’amabuye, agifate. Ingabo zo mu bumanuko n’ubwo zikerebutse mu kugwana, ntizizoshobora guhagarara imbere yiwe. <verse eid="DAN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 11:16" />Umwami wo mu buraruko azogenda umuraramango ata wumugwanya; nta n’umwe azoshobora kumuhagarara imbere. Azohagarara mu gihugu c’ubwiza ca Isirayeli, agomba kugisambura. <verse eid="DAN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 11:17" />Azogerageza gushiramwo inguvu z’ubwami bwiwe zose kandi agirane amasezerano n’umwami wo mu bumanuko, amushingire umukobwa wiwe kugira ngo iyo ngoma ayisenyure mu bwenge aciye imbere muri yo, ariko iyo migabo yiwe nta co izoshikako. <verse eid="DAN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 11:18" />Inyuma y’ivyo, azohindukirira amazinga kandi yigarurire menshi, ariko umukuru w’ingabo avuye mu kindi gihugu azomucisha bugufi atume asubira iwe amaramara. <verse eid="DAN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 11:19" />Ashitse azokwinyegeza mu bwihisho bwiwe, hanyuma atsitare atembe, nta wuzokwongera kumubona.<verse eid="DAN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 11:20" />Umusubirizi wiwe azotuma abatozakori kugira ngo ingoma yiwe igumane icubahiro. Ariko, amaze imisi mikeya ku ngoma, azopfa, yamara ntazoba yishwe n’uburake bw’umuntu canke n’intambara.<verse eid="DAN 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 11:21" />Uwuzoza mu nyuma, azoba ari umuntu akengeretse kandi atari mu nda y’ingoma. Azoza ata wumwiteze kandi afate ingoma akoresheje urwenge n’uruhendo. <verse eid="DAN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 11:22" />Ingabo nyinshi zizogwa imbere yiwe, harimwo n’umuganwa wo mu bwoko bufise isezerano. <verse eid="DAN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 11:23" />Azokoresha amasezerano menshi arimwo uruhendo. Naho abamushigikiye bazoba ari bake, azoguma akomera. <verse eid="DAN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 11:24" />Igihe intara zitunze cane zizoba zibereyeho ata co zinona, azozitera ashitse ivyo ba se canke ba sekuru batigeze bakora. Azofata ubutunzi yasahuye, abugabanganye abamushigikiye. Azogira imigabo yo gusenyura ahari ubwihisho bukomeye, ariko ivyo bizomara igihe gito.<verse eid="DAN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 11:25" />Mu nyuma, azokwihagararako yegeranye ingabo zikomeye zo kugwanya umwami wo mu bumanuko, hanyuma uwo na we azoja kumugwanya n’ingabo zikomeye, ariko nta co azoshikako kuko abandi bantu bazomuryaruka. <verse eid="DAN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 11:26" />Abantu bo mu nzu y’uwo mwami wo mu bumanuko ni bo bazotuma atemba, ingabo ziwe zishwiragire kandi ingabo nyinshi zizogwa ku rugamba. <verse eid="DAN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 11:27" />Abo bami babiri bazokwicarana ku meza bafise imitima ihengamiye ku kibi, maze bahendane; ariko nta kizovamwo kuko iherezo rizoshika igihe cashinzwe gishitse. <verse eid="DAN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 11:28" />Umwami wo mu buraruko azosubira iwe afise ubutunzi bwinshi. Ari ku nzira, azosotora abantu bafise isezerano n’Imana, kandi azokwonona vyinshi imbere yo gushika iwe.<verse eid="DAN 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 11:29" />Igihe gikwiye gishitse, azosubira atere mu bumanuko, ariko ico gihe ibintu ntibizomera nka mbere. <verse eid="DAN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 11:30" />Kuko amato y’intambara avuye mu burengero y’i Kitimu azomutera ubwoba, hanyuma abireke asubire iwe. Ariko ishavu ryiwe azorita ku bantu bafitaniye isezerano n’Imana kandi acudike n’abataye iryo sezerano.<verse eid="DAN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 11:31" />Ingabo ziwe zizokwigarurira ubwihisho bw’urusengero, bazokwanduza ahera h’urusengero, kandi babuze ko ibimazi vyo ku musi bitangwa, yongere akore ikizira gihumanya urusengero. <verse eid="DAN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 11:32" />Azokoresha urwenge n’uruhendo yikwegereko abavuye mw’isezerano ry’Imana. Ariko abantu bazi neza Imana yabo bazokomera kandi bamugwanye.<verse eid="DAN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 11:33" />Abarongozi baciye ubwenge bazokwigisha benshi, ariko kandi bamwe bazokwicishwa inkota, abandi baturirwe, abandi na bo bapfungwe bongere banyagwe ivyabo. <verse eid="DAN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 11:34" />Muri ivyo bihe vy’ihamwa, nta wuzobatabara, kandi n’abazokwerekana ko bari kumwe na bo bazoba babikora mu buryarya. <verse eid="DAN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 11:35" />Mu banyabwenge b’ico gihe, bamwe bazohitanwa n’iryo hamwa. Gutyo bazokwezwa batunganywe kugeza ku gihe c’iherezo, kuko igihe cashinzwe kitarashika.<verse eid="DAN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umwami yishira hejuru.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 11:36" />Umwami azokora ivyo yishakiye, yishire hejuru avuga ko ari agahambaye hejuru y’icitwa imana cose, mbere atuke Imana isumba ivyitwa imana vyose. Azokora ivyo ashaka vyose, ariko kugeza aho igihe cashinzwe ko uburake bumushikako kizoshikira, kuko ivyashinzwe, nta kabuza bizoshika. <verse eid="DAN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 11:37" />Ntazokwubaha imana za ba sekuruza, canke imana ikundwa n’abagore canke imana iyo ari yo yose, kuko azokwishira hejuru akavuga ko azisumba zose. <verse eid="DAN 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 11:38" />Mu gishingo cazo, azosenga imana ikingira ibisagara, imana ba sekuruza batigeze bamenya, azoyishikanira inzahabu, ifeza, amabuye y’agaciro hamwe n’izindi ngabire z’igiciro kinini. <verse eid="DAN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 11:39" />Mu kwerekana ko ico kigirwamana camufashije, azotera ahantu hakomeye ho kwihisha. Azoha icubahiro abemeye kumusaba, abashire mu bibanza vy’icubahiro hanyuma abagaburire igihugu nk’impera abahaye.<verse eid="DAN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 11:40" />Mu gihe ca nyuma, umwami wo mu bumanuko azotera umwami wo mu buraruko. Umwami wo mu buraruko azomushikako kurya kw’igihuhusi afise imikogote, abagwanira ku mafarasi n’ubwato. Azotera ibihugu vyinshi kandi imbibe zavyo azozirenga kurya kw’uruzi rusheshe. <verse eid="DAN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 11:41" />Azoshika mu gihugu c’ubwiza ari co Isirayeli, kandi amahanga menshi azomwikubita imbere, ariko Mowabu, Edomu n’igice kinini c’Abamoni bizomukira. <verse eid="DAN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 11:42" />Azokwigarurira ibihugu vyinshi, kandi na Egiputa ntikizomukira. <verse eid="DAN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 11:43" />Azoganza inzahabu, ifeza, hamwe n’ubutunzi bwa Egiputa kandi abo muri Libiya n’abo muri Etiyopiya bazomukorera. <verse eid="DAN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 11:44" />Ariko inkuru zivuye mu buseruko no mu buraruko zizomutera ubwoba, azoca agira uburake bwinshi agende kugeseza abantu benshi. <verse eid="DAN 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 11:45" />Azohagarara hagati y’umusozi watoranijwe n’ikiyaga, ahashinge amahema yiwe. Ariko, igihe azoba akiri ngaho, ukubaho kwiwe kuzorangira vuba, kandi nta muntu azoronka wo kumutabara.<verse eid="DAN 11:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DAN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ibihe vy’iherezo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 12:1" />Maze ico gihe, Mikaheli, umumarayika ahambaye w’ubwoko bwawe, azohaguruka. Hanyuma hazoba ibihe vy’umubabaro bikomeye kurusha ivyigeze kubaho kuva amahanga abayeho. Ariko, muri ico gihe, uwo mu bwoko bwanyu azoba yanditswe mu gitabu c’Imana azorokoka. <verse eid="DAN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 12:2" />Benshi mu bari mu mva bapfuye, bazozuka, bamwe bazozukira ubugingo budashira, abandi na bo bazukire ibimaramare n’ibiteterwe vy’ibihe bidashira. <verse eid="DAN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 12:3" />Abagize ubwenge bazokwakaka nk’umuco wo kw’ijuru, kandi abashikanye benshi ku kugororoka bazokwakaka nk’inyenyeri ibihe bidashira. <verse eid="DAN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 12:4" />Ariko, wewe Daniyeli, igitabu c’ubu buhanuzi ukigire ibanga, ucugare kugeza igihe c’iherezo gishitse. Abantu bazoja hirya no hino kugira ngo barondere kugwiza ubumenyi.”<verse eid="DAN 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 12:5" />Maze, Jewe Daniyeli, ndongera ndaraba, mbona imbere yanje hari abandi bantu babiri bahagaze ku yindi nkombe y’uruzi, umwe ari ku nkombe yo hakuno, uwundi ari ku yo hakurya. <verse eid="DAN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 12:6" />Umwe muri bo, abaza wa wundi yari yambaye impuzu zikayangana kandi yari ahagaze hejuru ku mazi y’urwo ruzi, ati: “Mbega hazoca igihe kingana iki kugira ngo ivyo bintu bikomeye gutyo bishike?”<verse eid="DAN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 12:7" />Uwo muntu yambaye impuzu zikayangana ahagaze hejuru y’uruzi, atumbereza amaboko yiwe yose mw’ijuru, aca arahira Iyibaho ibihe bidashira, avuga ati: “Bizomara igihe, ibihe, n’igice c’igihe. Igihe inkomezi z’ubwoko bw’Imana zizoba zirangiye, n’ivyo vyose bizoba biheze.”<verse eid="DAN 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 12:8" />Numva ivyo avuze, ariko sinabitahura, hanyuma nca ndabaza nti: “Mwami wanje, ivyo vyose bizorangira gute?”<verse eid="DAN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 12:9" />Aca aranyishura ati: “Daniyeli, niwigire kuko ayo majambo azoguma ari ibanga rihishijwe kugeza igihe c’iherezo. <verse eid="DAN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 12:10" />Benshi bazotunganywa, bezwe kandi batyororwe n’ivyo bihe vy’imibabaro. Ariko abanyakibi bo bazokomeza gukora ibibi, kandi nta n’umwe muri bo azogira ico atahura. Abagize ubwenge bonyene ni bo bazobitahura.<verse eid="DAN 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 12:11" />Kuva bahagaritse gutanga ikimazi gitangwa ku musi kandi ikizira gihumanya kigashingwa ngo gisengwe, hazoba hasigaye imisi igihumbi n’amajana abiri na mirongo icenda. <verse eid="DAN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 12:12" />Bazoba bahiriwe abantu bazoshobora kurindira gushika ku musi ugira igihumbi n’amajana atatu na mirongo itatu n’itanu.<verse eid="DAN 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 12:13" />Wewe Daniyeli, komeza ube umwizigirwa gushitsa kw’iherezo. Uzoruhuka, hanyuma ku mpera y’ibihe, uzovyuka kugira ngo uhabwe impera yawe wateguriwe.”<verse eid="DAN 12:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 12" />
</usx>